Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:44:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 21/22] Move: the backup check validSave goes from
 settings-screen.js to game/js/logic/saves.js

Same code (move-names.mjs verify: 1 statement moved). The Settings screen imports it for "Restore backup"; the
check reads only the data tables and teamSize, so it runs in plain Node with the rest of the save format.

Checked: lint, check:modules, format, build, smoke 14/14 (194 s).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LpFSn4GaodAVzjKW5J3oQR
